    "skos:narrowMatch is used to state a hierarchical mapping link between two conceptual resources in different concept schemes."@en .

skos:relatedMatch a rdf:Property, rdf:Property, owl:ObjectProperty, owl:ObjectProperty,
    owl:SymmetricProperty, owl:SymmetricProperty;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>, <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core>;
