:c_746ba6d7 a skos:Concept;
  skos:definition "Attends and participates in meetings, discussion, and trainings (when relevant). Provides information and contributes to action items; Supports the CC CoP to improve operational effectiveness of Reclamation's mission activities. Provides an alternate member to attend committee meetings when not available. Notifies the chair and secretary if unable to attend and provides any updates in writing."@en;
