variablename:porosity a skos:Concept;
  skos:definition "Porosity or void fraction is a measure of the void (i.e. \"empty\") spaces in a material, and is a fraction of the volume of voids over the total volume, between 0 and 1, or as a percentage between 0 and 100%.";
