    "densidade de corrente elétrica"@pt, "densità di corrente elettrica"@it, "densità di corrente elettrica"@it,
    "densité de courant"@fr, "densité de courant"@fr, "electric current density"@en, "electric current density"@en,
    "elektrische Stromdichte"@de, "elektrische Stromdichte"@de, "gostota električnega toka"@sl,
    "gostota električnega toka"@sl, "плотность тока"@ru, "плотность тока"@ru, "كثافة التيار"@ar,
    "كثافة التيار"@ar, "چگالی جریان الکتریکی"@fa, "چگالی جریان الکتریکی"@fa, "धारा घनत्व"@hi,
    "धारा घनत्व"@hi, "电流密度"@zh, "电流密度"@zh, "電流密度"@ja, "電流密度"@ja;
  rdfs:comment "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:ElectricCurrentDensity",
    "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:ElectricCurrentDensity";
  dct:description "\"Electric Current Density\" is a measure of the density of flow of electric charge; it is the electric current per unit area of cross section. Electric current density is a vector-valued quantity. Electric current, $I$, through a surface $S$ is defined as $I = \\int_S J \\cdot e_n dA$, where $e_ndA$ is the vector surface element."^^qudt:LatexString,
    "\"Electric Current Density\" is a measure of the density of flow of electric charge; it is the electric current per unit area of cross section. Electric current density is a vector-valued quantity. Electric current, $I$, through a surface $S$ is defined as $I = \\int_S J \\cdot e_n dA$, where $e_ndA$ is the vector surface element."^^qudt:LatexString;
