    "Henry per Metre"@en;
  dct:description "The henry per meter (symbolized $H/m$) is the unit of magnetic permeability in the International System of Units ( SI ). Reduced to base units in SI, $1\\,H/m$ is the equivalent of one kilogram meter per square second per square ampere."^^qudt:LatexString,
