    "Kilogram per Metre"@en;
  dct:description "Kilogram Per Meter (kg/m) is a unit in the category of Linear mass density. It is also known as kilogram/meter, kilogram/metre, kilograms per meter, kilogram per metre, kilograms per metre. This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system. Kilogram Per Meter (kg/m) has a dimension of ML-1 where $M$ is mass, and $L$ is length. This unit is the standard SI unit in this category. "^^rdf:HTML,
    "Kilogram Per Meter (kg/m) is a unit in the category of Linear mass density. It is also known as kilogram/meter, kilogram/metre, kilograms per meter, kilogram per metre, kilograms per metre. This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system. Kilogram Per Meter (kg/m) has a dimension of ML-1 where $M$ is mass, and $L$ is length. This unit is the standard SI unit in this category. "^^rdf:HTML;
