  qudt:plainTextDescription "Mass Concentration of Water is one of a number of Concentration quantities defined by ISO 80000.",
    "Mass Concentration of Water is one of a number of Concentration quantities defined by ISO 80000.";
  qudt:latexDefinition "$w = m/V$, where $m$ is mass of water, irrespective of the form of aggregation, and $V$ is volume. Mass concentration of water at saturation is denoted $w_{sat}$."^^qudt:LatexString,
