  rdfs:comment "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MolarAttenuationCoefficient",
    "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:MolarAttenuationCoefficient";
  dct:description "\"Molar Attenuation Coefficient\" is a measurement of how strongly a chemical species or substance absorbs or scatters light at a given wavelength, per amount of substance."^^qudt:LatexString,
    "\"Molar Attenuation Coefficient\" is a measurement of how strongly a chemical species or substance absorbs or scatters light at a given wavelength, per amount of substance."^^qudt:LatexString;
