  qudt:derivedCoherentUnitOfSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/SI>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/SI>;
  qudt:hasFactorUnit _:b1cb43fcbd504833bf8a964862c3127017069, _:b1cb43fcbd504833bf8a964862c3127017070 .

