  dct:description "$\\textit{abohm}$ is the basic unit of electrical resistance in the emu-cgs system of units. One abohm is equal to $10^{-9} ohms$ in the SI system of units; one abohm is a nano ohm."^^qudt:LatexString,
    "$\\textit{abohm}$ is the basic unit of electrical resistance in the emu-cgs system of units. One abohm is equal to $10^{-9} ohms$ in the SI system of units; one abohm is a nano ohm."^^qudt:LatexString;
