  rdfs:comment "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:CurvatureFromRadius", "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:CurvatureFromRadius";
  dct:description "In mathematics \"Curvature\" is the amount by which a geometric object deviates from being flat, or straight in the case of a line, but this is defined in different ways depending on the context."^^qudt:LatexString,
