    "radián za sekundu"@cs, "radyan bölü saniye"@tr, "radyan bölü saniye"@tr, "радиан в секунду"@ru,
    "радиан в секунду"@ru, "راديان في الثانية"@ar, "راديان في الثانية"@ar, "رادیان بر ثانیه"@fa,
    "رادیان بر ثانیه"@fa, "ラジアン毎秒"@ja, "ラジアン毎秒"@ja, "弧度每秒"@zh, "弧度每秒"@zh;
  dct:description "\"Radian per Second\" is the SI unit of rotational speed (angular velocity), and, also the unit of angular frequency. The radian per second is defined as the change in the orientation of an object, in radians, every second."^^rdf:HTML,
    "\"Radian per Second\" is the SI unit of rotational speed (angular velocity), and, also the unit of angular frequency. The radian per second is defined as the change in the orientation of an object, in radians, every second."^^rdf:HTML;
