unit:V-PER-M a qudt:Unit, qudt:Unit, qudt:DerivedUnit, qudt:DerivedUnit;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/3.0.0/vocab/unit>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit>;
  rdfs:label "مقياس التبادل، الأس السالب للمتر"@ar, "مقياس التبادل، الأس السالب للمتر"@ar,
    "Volt je Meter"@de, "Volt je Meter"@de, "Volt per Meter"@en-US, "Volt per Meter"@en-US,
    "volt al metro"@it, "volt al metro"@it, "volt bölü metre"@tr, "volt bölü metre"@tr,
    "volt na meter"@sl, "volt na meter"@sl, "volt par mètre"@fr, "volt par mètre"@fr,
    "volt per meter"@ms, "volt per meter"@ms, "volt per metre"@en, "volt per metre"@en,
    "volt por metro"@pt, "volt por metro"@pt, "voltio por metro"@es, "voltio por metro"@es,
    "voltů na metr"@cs, "voltů na metr"@cs, "volți pe metru"@ro, "volți pe metru"@ro,
    "wolt na metr"@pl, "wolt na metr"@pl, "вольт на метр"@ru, "вольт на метр"@ru, "ولت بر متر"@fa,
    "ولت بر متر"@fa, "प्रति मीटर वोल्ट"@hi, "प्रति मीटर वोल्ट"@hi, "ボルト毎メートル"@ja, "ボルト毎メートル"@ja,
    "伏特每米"@zh, "伏特每米"@zh;
  dct:description """
  The unit $\\{Volt Per Meter (V/m)}$ is a unit in the category of Electric field strength. 
  It is also known as volts per meter, volt/meter, volt/metre, volt per metre, volts per metre. 
  This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system. 
  $\\{Volt Per Meter}$ has a dimension of $MLT^{-3}I^{-1}$ where $M$ is mass, $L$ is length, $T$ is time, and $I$ is electric current. 
  This unit is the standard SI unit in this category.
  """^^qudt:LatexString,
    """
  The unit $\\{Volt Per Meter (V/m)}$ is a unit in the category of Electric field strength. 
  It is also known as volts per meter, volt/meter, volt/metre, volt per metre, volts per metre. 
  This unit is commonly used in the SI unit system. 
  $\\{Volt Per Meter}$ has a dimension of $MLT^{-3}I^{-1}$ where $M$ is mass, $L$ is length, $T$ is time, and $I$ is electric current. 
  This unit is the standard SI unit in this category.
  """^^qudt:LatexString;
  qudt:applicableSystem <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS-EMU>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS-EMU>,
    <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS-GAUSS>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/CGS-GAUSS>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/SI>,
    <http://qudt.org/vocab/sou/SI>;
  qudt:conversionMultiplier 1.0, 1.0;
  qudt:conversionMultiplierSN 1.0E0, 1.0E0;
  qudt:hasDimensionVector dimensionvector:A0E-1L1I0M1H0T-3D0, dimensionvector:A0E-1L1I0M1H0T-3D0;
  qudt:hasQuantityKind quantitykind:ElectricFieldStrength, quantitykind:ElectricFieldStrength,
    quantitykind:ElectricField, quantitykind:ElectricField;
  qudt:iec61360Code "0112/2///62720#UAA301", "0112/2///62720#UAA301";
