  qudt:omUnit <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/weber>, <http://www.ontology-of-units-of-measure.org/resource/om-2/weber>;
  qudt:siExactMatch <https://si-digital-framework.org/SI/units/weber>, <https://si-digital-framework.org/SI/units/weber>;
