  rdfs:label "Currency Unit", "Currency Unit";
  rdfs:comment "Currency Units have their own subclass of unit because: (a) they have additonal properites such as 'country' and (b) their URIs do not conform to the same rules as other units."^^rdf:HTML,
    "Currency Units have their own subclass of unit because: (a) they have additonal properites such as 'country' and (b) their URIs do not conform to the same rules as other units."^^rdf:HTML,
    "Used for all units that express currency."^^rdf:HTML, "Used for all units that express currency."^^rdf:HTML .

