  rdfs:comment "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Acceleration", "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Acceleration";
  dct:description "The acceleration of freely falling bodies under the influence of terrestrial gravity, equal to approximately 9.81 meters (32 feet) per second per second."^^qudt:LatexString,
