quantitykind:DragForce a qudt:QuantityKind, qudt:QuantityKind;
  rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://qudt.org/3.0.0/vocab/quantitykind>, <http://qudt.org/vocab/quantitykind>;
  rdfs:label "Drag Force"@en, "Drag Force"@en;
  rdfs:comment "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Force", "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Force";
  dct:description """In fluid dynamics, drag refers to forces which act on a solid object in the direction of the relative fluid flow velocity. Unlike other resistive forces such as dry friction, which is nearly independent of velocity, drag forces depend on velocity.
Drag forces always decrease fluid velocity relative to the solid object in the fluid's path.""",
    """In fluid dynamics, drag refers to forces which act on a solid object in the direction of the relative fluid flow velocity. Unlike other resistive forces such as dry friction, which is nearly independent of velocity, drag forces depend on velocity.
Drag forces always decrease fluid velocity relative to the solid object in the fluid's path.""";
  skos:broader quantitykind:Force, quantitykind:Force;
  qudt:hasDimensionVector dimensionvector:A0E0L1I0M1H0T-2D0, dimensionvector:A0E0L1I0M1H0T-2D0;
  qudt:symbol "D or F_D", "D or F_D";
  qudt:plainTextDescription """In fluid dynamics, drag refers to forces which act on a solid object in the direction of the relative fluid flow velocity. Unlike other resistive forces such as dry friction, which is nearly independent of velocity, drag forces depend on velocity.
Drag forces always decrease fluid velocity relative to the solid object in the fluid's path.""",
    """In fluid dynamics, drag refers to forces which act on a solid object in the direction of the relative fluid flow velocity. Unlike other resistive forces such as dry friction, which is nearly independent of velocity, drag forces depend on velocity.
Drag forces always decrease fluid velocity relative to the solid object in the fluid's path.""";
  qudt:applicableUnit unit:CentiN, unit:CentiN, unit:DYN, unit:DYN, unit:DeciN, unit:DeciN,
    unit:GM_F, unit:GM_F, unit:KIP_F, unit:KIP_F, unit:KiloGM-M-PER-SEC2, unit:KiloGM-M-PER-SEC2,
    unit:N, unit:N, unit:KiloGM_F, unit:KiloGM_F, unit:KiloPOND, unit:KiloPOND, unit:KiloLB_F,
    unit:KiloLB_F, unit:KiloN, unit:KiloN, unit:LB_F, unit:LB_F, unit:MegaLB_F, unit:MegaLB_F,
