  rdfs:comment "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Acceleration", "Applicable units are those of quantitykind:Acceleration";
  dct:description "In a compressible sound transmission medium - mainly air - air particles get an accelerated motion: the particle acceleration or sound acceleration with the symbol a in $m/s2$. In acoustics or physics, acceleration (symbol: $a$) is defined as the rate of change (or time derivative) of velocity."^^qudt:LatexString,
    "In a compressible sound transmission medium - mainly air - air particles get an accelerated motion: the particle acceleration or sound acceleration with the symbol a in $m/s2$. In acoustics or physics, acceleration (symbol: $a$) is defined as the rate of change (or time derivative) of velocity."^^qudt:LatexString;
